---
import {site,asset} from '../config/site';
import Button from './Button.astro';
---
<section class="final-cta wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">OOK IN VOOR SURVIVAL?</p><h2>Kom erbij op Discord.</h2><p>Stel je vragen, zoek iemand om mee te bouwen of praat gewoon mee.</p></div><Button href={site.discord} external>Join onze Discord</Button></section>
<footer class="footer wrap"><a class="brand" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}><img src={asset(site.assets.logo)} alt="" width="38" height="38"/><span>BlokBuren<span class="brand-smp">SMP</span></span></a><p>Gewoon survival. Met je buren.</p><div class="footer-links">{Object.entries(site.social).map(([key,url]) => url ? <a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{key === 'tiktok' ? 'TikTok' : 'YouTube'}</a> : <span>{key === 'tiktok' ? 'TikTok' : 'YouTube'} <small>volgt</small></span>)}<a href={site.discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact ↗</a></div><small class="footer-legal">© {new Date().getFullYear()} BlokBuren SMP · Onze eigen Minecraft-community. Niet van Mojang of Microsoft.</small></footer>
